        "derivation": "The README describes snapshot restoration as substituting for replay of old logs. takeSnapshot persists captured state and metadata before initiating compaction, while startup recovery adopts snapshot indexes and configuration. Their dependency creates a recovery obligation spanning both sides of reclamation.",
