  "understanding": "The supplied implementation exposes two consequential dependency chains: stored-prefix reports feed a voter-based commitment accumulator and ultimately FSM application; captured FSM state and committed configuration feed snapshots that permit log reclamation and later startup recovery. Membership, transport variants, batching, storage contracts and startup configuration change the applicable guarantees. The material supports a bounded accumulator check and a secondary snapshot-orchestration check, while several producer and consumer contracts remain unresolved.",
